- Analytics strategies have symmetric or right-skewed distributions (confidence in direction).
- Intuition strategies use student-t and skew-normal to reflect higher uncertainty and asymmetric risks.
- The Python script plots all six priors, showing each distribution's shape, computed 95% interval, and marked most-plausible value.

